# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fluency Talks — Cloudflare Pages _redirects
#
# 1) Permanently redirect every legacy / alternate host to the canonical
#    domain https://thefluencytalks.com, keeping the original path.
#    Mirrors the host redirects previously in vercel.json.
# 2) SPA fallback: anything that isn't a real file serves /index.html so
#    React Router handles client-side routes. Must stay LAST.
#
# Format:  source  destination  status
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Redirects from old / www hosts to the canonical apex domain.
http://fluencytalks.com/*      https://thefluencytalks.com/:splat  301
https://fluencytalks.com/*     https://thefluencytalks.com/:splat  301
http://www.fluencytalks.com/*  https://thefluencytalks.com/:splat  301
https://www.fluencytalks.com/* https://thefluencytalks.com/:splat  301
http://www.thefluencytalks.com/* https://thefluencytalks.com/:splat 301
https://www.thefluencytalks.com/* https://thefluencytalks.com/:splat 301

# SPA fallback — React Router handles the route client-side.
/*  /index.html  200
